## Deployment Steps

### Step 1 — Create script on each node

```bash
mkdir -p /opt/apigee/scripts
# paste script content above
chmod 750 /opt/apigee/scripts/zk_health_check.sh
chown apigee:apigee /opt/apigee/scripts/zk_health_check.sh
```

### Step 2 — Create log file

```bash
touch /var/log/zk_health.log
chmod 644 /var/log/zk_health.log
chown apigee:apigee /var/log/zk_health.log
```

> `644` required so Dynatrace OneAgent can read the log file.

### Step 3 — Test run

```bash
bash /opt/apigee/scripts/zk_health_check.sh
cat /var/log/zk_health.log
```

Expected healthy output:
```
[2026-03-22 11:20:24] ===== ZK Health Check Start =====
[2026-03-22 11:20:24] Node ZK-NODE-1-IP: ruok=imok OK
[2026-03-22 11:20:24] Node ZK-NODE-1-IP: mode=follower
...
[2026-03-22 11:20:24] Quorum: leaders=1 followers=2 reachable=3/3
[2026-03-22 11:20:24] ===== ZK Health Check Complete =====
```

### Step 4 — Schedule cron

```bash
crontab -e
# Add:
*/5 * * * * /opt/apigee/scripts/zk_health_check.sh
```

### Step 5 — Configure logrotate

```bash
cat > /etc/logrotate.d/zk_health << 'EOF'
/var/log/zk_health.log {
    daily
    rotate 14
    compress
    delaycompress
    missingok
    notifempty
    dateext
    dateformat -%Y%m%d
}
EOF

logrotate -d /etc/logrotate.d/zk_health
```

