## Runtime Impact Assessment

| Metric | Impact |
|---|---|
| CPU | ~50ms execution per run — negligible on 8-core servers |
| RAM | ~3-4MB during execution, released immediately |
| Disk | ~500KB/day log growth, capped at 14 days (~3MB total) |
| ZK traffic | Read-only four-letter commands via dedicated admin thread |
| API traffic | Zero — no interaction with Apigee runtime pipeline |

