## Notes

- `pending_syncs` is empty on followers (`.80`, `.81`) — this is expected. Only the leader (`.82`) reports this metric.
- `watch_count=387` on ZK-NODE-1 is higher than other nodes — monitor over time. May indicate one Apigee component connecting preferentially to this node.
- Dynatrace OneAgent is active on all 3 nodes — log monitoring can be configured via Dynatrace UI under `Settings → Log Monitoring → Log sources` pointing to `/var/log/zk_health.log`.
- No CMR required for this deployment — script uses only read-only ZK four-letter commands and writes only to local log file.
